      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “People of Judah, your sin is written with an iron pen; it is engraved on your hearts with a diamond point and carved on the corners of your altars. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your people worship at the altars and the symbols that have been set up for the goddess Asherah by every green tree, on the hilltops ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and on the mountains in the open country. I will make your enemies take away your wealth and your treasures because of all the sins you have committed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "because of all the sins you have committed",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "your high places for sins.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " throughout your land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will have to give up",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "You",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "give up",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the land I gave you, and I will make you serve your enemies in a land you know nothing about, because my anger is like a fire, and it will burn for ever.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
